 366:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/../../../misc/lv_color.h ****  * Convert am RGB888 color to XRGB8888 stored in `uint32_t`
 367:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/../../../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param color     and RGB888 color
 368:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/../../../misc/lv_color.h ****  * @return          `color` as XRGB8888 on `uin32_t` (the alpha channel is always set to 0xFF)
 369:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/../../../misc/lv_color.h ****  */
